name: Git Branch Name Generator
description: Suggest the correct git branch name and creation command
---
Based on the following task description:

{input}

1. Suggest a git branch name following this convention:
   - feature/   → new functionality
   - fix/        → bug fixes
   - docs/       → documentation only changes
   - refactor/   → code improvements, no behavior change
   - chore/      → dependencies, config, tooling updates

   Format: type/short-kebab-case-description
   Keep it under 40 characters. Be specific, not generic.

2. Provide the exact git commands to:
   - Switch to dev branch
   - Pull latest changes
   - Create and switch to the new branch

3. Remind me what to do when the work is done (push + merge request to dev, not main)
